The VOCDetection dataset returns labels in a different format than what Faster R-CNN expects. VOCDetection returns:
```
{
    'annotation': {
        'object': [
            {'bndbox': {'xmin': ..., 'xmax': ..., 'ymin': ..., 'ymax': ...}, 'name': ...},
            ...
        ]
    }
}
```

But Faster R-CNN expects:
```
{
    'boxes': tensor(...),
    'labels': tensor(...),
    'image_id': ...,
    'area': tensor(...),
    'iscrowd': tensor(...)
}
```

I need to create a transformation function to convert labels.

